    },
    {
      "text": "１ターンめで　どこかに　きえて\n２ターンめに　あいてを　こうげきする。\nまもりを　むしして　こうげきできる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "1턴째에 어디론가 사라져서\n2턴째에 상대를 공격한다.\n기술 방어를 무시하고 공격할 수 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "使用後的第１回合消失到某處，\n並於第２回合攻擊對手。\n可不顧對手的守護進行攻擊。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur disparaît au premier tour et frappe au second.\nCette attaque passe outre les protections.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Der Anwender verschwindet in Runde 1, um seine Kraft\nzu sammeln, und attackiert in Runde 2. Trifft auch,\nwenn sich das Ziel selbst schützt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El usuario desaparece en el primer turno y ataca a su\nobjetivo en el segundo. Permite acertar aunque el\nobjetivo esté protegiéndose.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa scompare improvvisamente per attaccare\npoi nel turno seguente. Questa mossa neutralizza\nle protezioni del bersaglio.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user vanishes somewhere, then strikes the\ntarget on the next turn. This move hits even if the\ntarget protects itself.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "１ターンめで　どこかに　消えて\n２ターンめに　相手を　攻撃する。\n守りを　無視して　攻撃できる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
